<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1582) <span class="when">Oct 14, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>One view for every clip, or one for each file.</b> Settings &#9656; Color has <b>Display and view</b>: the same for every clip, as before, or remembered for each file, with a default for files nobody has set.</li>
<li><b>Pull Plates with two conformed cuts.</b> Going to another tab with the Pull Plates window open no longer quits Asobi; the window shows that tab&#8217;s cut.</li>
<li><b>Check Frames without the wait.</b> A pull checks each frame as it writes it, from the picture it already has, instead of reading the whole plate back over the network afterwards.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
