<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1579) <span class="when">Oct 14, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Rewrite Frames.</b> A plate whose check found frames to look at has <b>Rewrite Frames</b> on its row: those frames alone are written again, in the version they are in, and the plate is checked again.</li>
<li><b>What the check found is kept.</b> Check Frames&#8217; findings go into each plate&#8217;s record, so after a restart (or on another Mac) Pull Plates still shows which plates have frames to check. <b>Check Plates on Disk</b> checks plates pulled before this build.</li>
<li><b>Pictures in the conform report.</b> When you save the report you can have a picture of each shot beside its number, and the Edit Ref&#8217;s frame at the same place beside it. The shot list names its counts (&#8220;48 Dur&#8221;, &#8220;29 Frames&#8221;) and has a <b>Handles</b> column.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
